WEBVTT

00:27:27.382 --> 00:27:31.246
from someone who did not
choose me for a position.

00:27:31.270 --> 00:27:35.016
He says, "You know, your reputation
is that you're cynical and negative."

00:27:35.040 --> 00:27:36.986
And I was like, "Wow."

00:27:37.010 --> 00:27:39.058
AG: Unfortunately,
the pressure to conform

00:27:39.082 --> 00:27:42.576
can be even stronger for members
of nondominant groups.

00:27:42.600 --> 00:27:44.606
That might be true
if you're a salesperson

00:27:44.630 --> 00:27:47.346
in an organization dominated by engineers,

00:27:47.370 --> 00:27:50.456
or a native Southerner
in a team of New Yorkers,

00:27:50.480 --> 00:27:53.376
or more fundamentally, a woman of color

00:27:53.400 --> 00:27:56.046
in a workplace run by white men.

00:27:56.070 --> 00:27:58.348
For Carmen, being a double minority

00:27:58.372 --> 00:28:01.936
amplified the challenges
of having heretical views.